  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p><p>The above reaction is of zero order. Half life of this reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. The time taken for the concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to reduce to one-fourth of its initial value is min .&nbsp;(Nearest integer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The integrated rate equation of zero order reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kt</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></math></p><p>Assume reaction starts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole A</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></math> completion</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>kt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p>"
  }
